WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Open the leaderboard. Records ranked from their settled calls.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:13.900
Open a record. Each row links its calls and their proofs.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:25.600
Open a proof. The verdict, the settlement transaction and both signed prints.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.700
Re-verify the close. The browser reads the recording transaction and asks the verifier contract again.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:34.100
Verified. The close passes twice: its record transaction and the archive. This open is the previous Window's close.
